        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2579] The ContractCertificateChain received by the EVCC in the CertificateInstallationRes Message shall be stored persistently in such a way, that it can be applied later on for the purpose of verifying PriceSchedules. The eMSP sub-CA2 certificate is required to verify PriceSchedules.",
